title Step 2 — Outbound Payment, Happy Path

Service [color: green] {
  Payments API [icon: server]
  Posting Engine [icon: cpu]
  Partner Adapter [icon: repeat]
}

Ledger DB [icon: postgresql, color: purple] {
  accounts [icon: table]
  ledger_entries [icon: table]
  balances [icon: table]
  payments [icon: table]
}

External [color: red] {
  BaaS Partner [icon: credit-card]
}

Payments API > Posting Engine: pay bill
Posting Engine > Ledger DB: CASH to PENDING_OUT, insert payment
Posting Engine > Partner Adapter: submit transfer
Partner Adapter > BaaS Partner: ACH debit
BaaS Partner > Partner Adapter: settled callback
Partner Adapter > Posting Engine: settle
Posting Engine > Ledger DB: PENDING_OUT to PARTNER_CASH